      <string id="DisableMasterPasswordCreation">Prevent creating a primary password</string>
      <string id="DisableMasterPasswordCreation_Explain">If true, a master password can’t be created.

Remove the master password functionality.

If this value is true, it works the same as setting PrimaryPassword (#primarypassword) to false and removes the primary password functionality.

If both DisableMasterPasswordCreation and PrimaryPassword are used, DisableMasterPasswordCreation takes precedence.

For more information visit: https://thunderbird.github.io/policy-templates/policies/esr153/#disablemasterpasswordcreation
</string>
